<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a> offers gear equivalent to normal raid quality gear and has particularly strong trinkets gated behind <span class="rep-friendly">Friendly</span> reputation.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shado-pan-assault">
